---
import { nav, site } from '../data/content';
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-white/6 py-12">
  <div class="container-page flex flex-col gap-8">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-8 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between">
      <div class="max-w-xs">
        <a href="#top" class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-mist-50">
          {site.name}<span class="text-gold-500">.</span>
        </a>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-mist-500">
          Лендинги под трафик: смыслы, дизайн, вёрстка. Два проекта в месяц.
        </p>
      </div>

      <nav aria-label="Разделы" class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-8 gap-y-3">
        {
          nav.map((item) => (
            <a href={item.href} class="text-sm text-mist-300 transition-colors hover:text-mist-50">
              {item.label}
            </a>
          ))
        }
      </nav>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm">
        <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`} class="text-mist-300 transition-colors hover:text-mist-50">
          {site.email}
        </a>
        <a href={site.telegram} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-mist-300 transition-colors hover:text-mist-50">
          Telegram
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 border-t border-white/6 pt-6 text-xs text-mist-500 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
      <p>&copy; {year} {site.name}. Все права защищены.</p>
      <a href="/privacy" class="transition-colors hover:text-mist-300">Политика конфиденциальности</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
